'''Pokémon Flute''' (Japanese: '''ポケモンの笛''' ''Pokémon Flute'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Put a Basic Pokémon from your opponent's discard pile onto their Bench.
}}

==Trivia==
This card's effect is identical to that of the {{TCG|Pokémon Flute}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].
===Origin===
* This card is based on the [[Poké Flute]], an important item in the Pokémon games. This card uses the English name "Pokémon Flute" as a full translation of the Japanese card name, instead of the item's English name "Poké Flute". This card's illustration depicts the Poké Flute as it appears in {{LGPE}}.

